176
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,100
I'll tell you what.
我會告訴你什麼。

177
00:08:53,160 --> 00:08:55,060
I'll put you down for eight boxes, one for each night.
我會給你八盒，每晚一盒。

178
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:57,000
Ma?
媽？

179
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:58,380
All right.
好的。

180
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,940
I'll take one box of the mint treasures.
我要一盒薄荷珍品。

181
00:09:00,500 --> 00:09:01,440
One, and that's it.
一，僅此而已。

182
00:09:02,060 --> 00:09:04,300
I started gaining weight after I joined the Brown Birds.
加入棕鳥隊後，我的體重開始增加。

183
00:09:04,780 --> 00:09:05,100
Remember?
記住？

184
00:09:05,500 --> 00:09:07,860
Dad bought every one of my boxes, and I ate them all.
爸爸把我的每一盒都買了，我都吃完了。

185
00:09:09,780 --> 00:09:10,340
I know, Ma.
我知道，媽。

186
00:09:10,580 --> 00:09:14,200
Dad had to buy every one of your boxes because you ate them
爸爸必須買下你的每一盒，因為你把它們吃了

187
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:14,400
all.
全部。

188
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:20,600
But, uh, you know, I'm sure that's not going to happen this year.
但是，呃，你知道，我確信今年不會發生這種情況。

189
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:24,460
This time, why don't I just put you down for three of the
這一次，我為什麼不直接讓你失望三分呢？

190
00:09:24,460 --> 00:09:26,820
mint treasures and just a couple of the Rudolphs?
鑄幣珍品和幾個魯道夫家族？

191
00:09:27,140 --> 00:09:27,480
No.
不。

192
00:09:30,500 --> 00:09:31,700
Oh, come on, now.
哦，來吧，現在。

193
00:09:31,780 --> 00:09:32,840
You know you want them.
你知道你想要它們。

194
00:09:34,300 --> 00:09:35,960
Don't, don't, don't do this.
不要，不要，不要這樣做。

195
00:09:36,540 --> 00:09:37,460
I'll tell you what, Ma.
我會告訴你什麼，媽媽。

196
00:09:37,660 --> 00:09:40,000
I'll give you the first box for free.
我會免費給你第一個盒子。

197
00:09:42,200 --> 00:09:43,420
Oh, God, I gotta go.
哦，上帝，我得走了。

198
00:09:43,900 --> 00:09:46,160
Come on, all the cool kids are eating them.
來吧，所有很酷的孩子都在吃它們。

199
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:46,400
Thank you.
謝謝。

200
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:51,680
And when you have a second later, I want to show you why
當你稍後有時間時，我想告訴你為什麼

201
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:54,300
we don't just trap spiders under coffee mugs and leave them there.
我們不只是把蜘蛛困在咖啡杯下面然後把它們留在那裡。

202
00:09:58,680 --> 00:10:01,140
I'm training to be better at a job that I hate.
我正在接受培訓，以便在我討厭的工作上做得更好。

203
00:10:01,420 --> 00:10:02,800
My life officially sucks.
我的生活正式很糟糕。

204
00:10:03,300 --> 00:10:05,500
But, Rach, wasn't it supposed to be a temporary thing?
但是，瑞秋，這不應該是暫時的嗎？

205
00:10:05,620 --> 00:10:07,320
I thought you wanted to do fashion stuff.
我以為你想做時尚的事。

206
00:10:07,460 --> 00:10:09,600
Well, yeah, I'm still pursuing that.
嗯，是的，我仍在追求這一點。

207
00:10:10,660 --> 00:10:12,380
How exactly are you pursuing that?
你究竟是如何追求的？

208
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:16,540
You know, other than sending out resumes like, what, two years ago?
你知道，除了兩年前寄出履歷之外，還有什麼？

209
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:22,060
Well, I'm also sending out good thoughts.
嗯，我也發出一些好的想法。

210
00:10:24,160 --> 00:10:27,680
If you ask me, as long as you got this job, you got
如果你問我，只要你得到這份工作，你就得到了

211
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:29,540
nothing pushing you to get another one.
沒有什麼會促使你去買另一件。

212
00:10:30,280 --> 00:10:31,340
You need the fear.
你需要恐懼。

213
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:33,240
The fear?
恐懼？

214
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:34,400
He's right.
他是對的。

215
00:10:34,500 --> 00:10:37,740
If you quit this job, you then have motivation to go after a
如果你辭掉這份工作，你就會有動力去追求

216
00:10:37,740 --> 00:10:38,960
job you really want.
你真正想要的工作。

217
00:10:39,340 --> 00:10:41,100
Well, then how come you're still at a job that you hate?
好吧，那你為什麼還在做你討厭的工作呢？

218
00:10:41,100 --> 00:10:43,300
I mean, why don't you quit and get the fear?
我的意思是，為什麼不放棄並接受恐懼呢？

219
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:46,640
Because I'm too afraid.
因為我太害怕了。

220
00:10:49,280 --> 00:10:50,360
I don't know.
我不知道。

221
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:53,300
I mean, I would give anything to work for a designer, you know,
我的意思是，我願意付出一切來為設計師工作，你知道，

222
00:10:53,300 --> 00:10:54,000
or a buyer.
或買家。

223
00:10:54,920 --> 00:10:57,640
I just don't want to be 30 and still work here.
我只是不想30歲了還在這裡工作。

224
00:10:58,020 --> 00:11:01,900
Yeah, that'd be much worse than being 28 and still working here.
是的，這比 28 歲了還在這裡工作要糟糕得多。

225
00:11:03,280 --> 00:11:03,720
Rachel?
雷切爾？

226
00:11:04,300 --> 00:11:04,700
Yeah?
是的？

227
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:07,900
Remind me to review with you which pot is decaf and which is
提醒我和你一起回顧哪個壺是無咖啡因的，哪個是

228
00:11:07,900 --> 00:11:08,220
regular.
常規的。

229
00:11:11,100 --> 00:11:13,120
Can't I just look at the handles on them?
我不能只看它們的把手嗎？

230
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:14,240
You would think.
你可能會想。

231
00:11:16,040 --> 00:11:16,880
Okay, fine.
好吧，好吧。

232
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,280
Gunther, you know what?
岡瑟，你知道嗎？

233
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:20,220
I am a terrible waitress.
我是一個糟糕的女服務生。

234
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:22,400
Do you know why I am a terrible waitress?
你知道為什麼我是一個糟糕的女服務生嗎？

235
00:11:22,700 --> 00:11:24,180
Because I don't care.
因為我不在乎。

236
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:25,380
I don't care.
我不在乎。

237
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:28,080
I don't care which pot is regular and which pot is decaf.
我不在乎哪一壺是普通的，哪一壺是無咖啡因的。

238
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:30,100
I don't care where the tray spot is.
我不在乎託盤位置在哪裡。

239
00:11:30,160 --> 00:11:30,900
I just don't care.
我只是不在乎。

240
00:11:30,980 --> 00:11:32,180
This is not what I want to do.
這不是我想做的事。

241
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:36,220
So I don't think I should do it anymore.
所以我認為我不應該再這樣做了。

242
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:39,940
I'm going to give you my week's notice.
我將向您發出一週的通知。

243
00:11:39,940 --> 00:11:40,660
What?
什麼？

244
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:42,100
Gunther, I quit.
岡瑟，我辭職了。

245
00:11:44,700 --> 00:11:47,140
Does this mean we're going to have to start paying for coffee?
這是否意味著我們將不得不開始為咖啡付費？

246
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:54,960
Okay, 12.
好的，12。

247
00:11:55,980 --> 00:11:56,820
22.
22.

248
00:11:58,220 --> 00:11:58,920
18.
18.

249
00:12:00,580 --> 00:12:01,080
What?
什麼？

250
00:12:05,280 --> 00:12:06,700
I spelled out boobies.
我拼出了胸部。

251
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:14,900
Ross, put me down for another box of the Mint Treasures, okay?
羅斯，讓我再買一盒薄荷珍寶，好嗎？

252
00:12:16,140 --> 00:12:17,080
Where are the Mint Treasures?
薄荷寶藏在哪裡？

253
00:12:19,060 --> 00:12:20,160
Uh, we're out.
呃，我們出去了。

254
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,140
I sold them all.
我把它們都賣了。

255
00:12:21,900 --> 00:12:22,260
What?
什麼？

256
00:12:23,980 --> 00:12:25,660
Monica, I'm cutting you off.
莫妮卡，我要打斷你了。

257
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:28,560
No.
不。

258
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:29,980
No.
不。

259
00:12:31,800 --> 00:12:33,280
Just a couple more boxes.
再多幾盒就好了。

260
00:12:35,180 --> 00:12:36,680
It's no big deal, right?
沒什麼大不了的，對吧？

261
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:37,480
I'm cool.
我很酷。

262
00:12:39,300 --> 00:12:41,480
You gotta help me out with a couple more boxes.
你得幫我多拿幾個盒子。

263
00:12:43,380 --> 00:12:44,500
Mom, look at yourself.
媽媽，看看你自己。

264
00:12:44,620 --> 00:12:45,760
You have cookie on your neck.
你脖子上掛著餅乾。

265
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:52,040
So, how many have you sold so far?
那麼，到目前為止你已經賣了多少了？

266
00:12:52,140 --> 00:12:53,040
Check this out.
看看這個。

267
00:12:54,860 --> 00:12:55,740
517 boxes.
517盒。

268
00:12:56,340 --> 00:12:57,220
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

269
00:12:57,240 --> 00:12:58,060
How did you do that?
你是怎麼做到的？

270
00:12:58,220 --> 00:13:02,320
Okay, the other night I was leaving the museum just as Laser Floyd
好吧，那天晚上我正像雷射弗洛伊德一樣離開博物館

271
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:06,280
was letting out of the planetarium without even trying.
甚至沒有嘗試就離開了天文館。

272
00:13:06,380 --> 00:13:07,460
I sold 50 boxes.
我賣了50盒。

273
00:13:08,180 --> 00:13:11,960
That's when it occurred to me, the key to my success, the munchies.
就在那時我想到了，我成功的關鍵就是零食。

274
00:13:13,460 --> 00:13:17,100
So, I started hitting the NYU dorms around midnight.
所以，我在午夜左右開始去紐約大學宿舍。

275
00:13:19,940 --> 00:13:22,300
I am selling cookies by the case.
我是按箱賣餅乾的。

276
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:25,960
They call me Cookie Dude.
他們叫我餅乾哥們。

277
00:13:29,680 --> 00:13:31,440
Okay, but I'm not gonna call you that.
好吧，但我不會這樣稱呼你。

278
00:13:34,020 --> 00:13:35,500
Okay, stop what you're doing.
好吧，停止你正在做的事情。

279
00:13:35,640 --> 00:13:36,760
I need envelope stuffers.
我需要信封填充器。

280
00:13:36,760 --> 00:13:37,980
I need stamp lickers.
我需要舔郵票者。

281
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:38,640
Oh, hey.
哦，嘿。

282
00:13:38,760 --> 00:13:40,480
Who did these resumes for you?
這些履歷是誰給你做的？

283
00:13:40,580 --> 00:13:41,860
Me on my computer.
我在電腦上。

284
00:13:42,320 --> 00:13:43,820
You sure used a large font?
你確定用了大字型？

285
00:13:44,400 --> 00:13:44,880
Uh, yeah.
呃，是的。

286
00:13:45,180 --> 00:13:49,020
Well, a waitress at a coffee house and a cheer squad co-captain
好吧，咖啡館的女服務員和啦啦隊的副隊長

287
00:13:49,020 --> 00:13:50,200
only took up so much room.
只佔了這麼多空間。

288
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:53,620
Hey, that's funny.
嘿，這很有趣。

289
00:13:54,060 --> 00:13:55,260
You're funny, Chandler.
你很有趣，錢德勒。

290
00:13:55,420 --> 00:13:56,640
You're a funny guy.
你是個有趣的人。

291
00:13:56,860 --> 00:13:58,180
You know what else is really funny?
你知道還有什麼真正有趣嗎？

292
00:13:59,380 --> 00:14:00,920
Something else I might have said?
我還可以說些什麼嗎？

293
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:03,780
I don't know, I don't know.
我不知道，我不知道。

294
00:14:04,020 --> 00:14:06,700
Weren't you the guy that told me to quit my job when I
你不是那個讓我辭職的人嗎？

295
00:14:06,700 --> 00:14:08,680
had absolutely nothing else to do?
完全沒有別的事可做嗎？

296
00:14:12,580 --> 00:14:13,520
Sweetie, calm down.
親愛的，冷靜點。

297
00:14:13,580 --> 00:14:14,420
It's gonna be okay.
會沒事的。

298
00:14:14,620 --> 00:14:16,480
No, it's not gonna be okay, Ross.
不，不會有事的，羅斯。

299
00:14:16,580 --> 00:14:19,600
Tomorrow is my last day and I don't have a lead.
明天是我的最後一天，我沒有領先優勢。

300
00:14:20,640 --> 00:14:21,460
Okay, you know what?
好吧，你知道嗎？

301
00:14:21,500 --> 00:14:24,600
I'm just gonna call Gunther and I'm gonna tell him I'm not quitting.
我會打電話給岡瑟，告訴他我不會放棄。

302
00:14:25,780 --> 00:14:27,640
You don't want to give in to the fear?
你不想屈服於恐懼嗎？

303
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:30,620
You and your stupid fear.
你和你愚蠢的恐懼。

304
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:31,620
I hate your fear.
我討厭你的恐懼。

305
00:14:31,680 --> 00:14:33,620
I would like to take you and your fear.
我想帶走你和你的恐懼。

306
00:14:33,620 --> 00:14:34,420
Hey!
嘿！

307
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:36,600
I got great news.
我得到了好訊息。

308
00:14:36,700 --> 00:14:38,100
Run, Joey, run for your life!
奔跑吧，喬伊，為你的生命奔跑！

309
00:14:41,060 --> 00:14:41,460
What?
什麼？

310
00:14:42,220 --> 00:14:42,860
Rachel, listen.
雷切爾，聽著。

311
00:14:43,200 --> 00:14:44,860
Have you ever heard of Fortunata Fashions?
您聽過福爾圖納塔時裝嗎？

312
00:14:45,140 --> 00:14:45,520
No.
不。

313
00:14:45,860 --> 00:14:48,620
Well, my old man's doing a plumbing job down there and he heard
嗯，我的老人正在下面做管道工作，他聽到

314
00:14:48,620 --> 00:14:49,340
they have an opening.
他們有一個空缺。

315
00:14:49,740 --> 00:14:51,600
So you want me to see if he can get you an interview?
所以你想讓我看看他能否為你安排面試機會？

316
00:14:51,940 --> 00:14:52,820
Oh, my God, yes.
哦，天哪，是的。

317
00:14:52,880 --> 00:14:53,780
I would love that.
我會喜歡的。

318
00:14:53,900 --> 00:14:55,400
Oh, that's so sweet, Joey.
哦，那真是太好了，喬伊。

319
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:56,960
Not a problem.
不是問題。

320
00:14:57,220 --> 00:14:59,440
And now for the great news.
現在是好訊息。

321
00:15:00,020 --> 00:15:01,420
What, that wasn't the great news?
什麼，這不是好訊息嗎？

322
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:03,660
Only if you think it's better than this.
僅當您認為它比這更好時。

323
00:15:04,460 --> 00:15:05,300
Snow in a can!
罐頭裡的雪！

324
00:15:07,460 --> 00:15:08,500
I got it at work.
我在工作時得到的。

325
00:15:08,740 --> 00:15:10,040
Come on, you want me to decorate the window?
來吧，你要我裝飾窗戶嗎？

326
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:11,960
Give it kind of a Christmas looky?
給它一種聖誕節的感覺？

327
00:15:12,500 --> 00:15:13,160
Christmas cookie?
聖誕餅乾？

328
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:22,020
Okay, and this one here's a Douglas fir.
好的，這是一棵花旗松。

329
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:24,500
Now, it's a little more money, but you get a nicer smell.
現在，錢多了一點，但你得到了更好的氣味。

330
00:15:26,560 --> 00:15:27,520
That's good, I'll take it.
那就好，我就收下來了。

331
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:29,420
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.
等等，等等，等等，等等，等等。

332
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:30,420
No, no, no, you don't want that one.
不，不，不，你不要那個。

333
00:15:30,420 --> 00:15:33,500
No, you can have this cool brown one.
不，你可以擁有這款酷炫的棕色。

334
00:15:35,620 --> 00:15:37,080
It's almost dead.
它快死了。

335
00:15:38,060 --> 00:15:40,620
Okay, but that's why you have to buy it, so that it can
好吧，但這就是為什麼你必須購買它，這樣它才能

336
00:15:40,620 --> 00:15:41,920
fulfill its Christmas destiny.
完成它的聖誕節使命。

337
00:15:42,180 --> 00:15:43,900
Otherwise, they're going to throw it into the chipper.
否則，他們會把它丟進削片機。

338
00:15:44,080 --> 00:15:44,540
Tell him, Joey.
告訴他，喬伊。

339
00:15:46,380 --> 00:15:51,240
Yeah, the trees that don't fulfill their Christmas destiny are thrown in the
是的，那些沒有完成聖誕節使命的樹被丟進了

340
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:51,460
chipper.
削片機。

341
00:15:53,540 --> 00:15:55,860
I think I'm going to look around a little bit more.
我想我要多看看周圍。

342
00:15:57,620 --> 00:16:00,400
Hey, you've got to stop doing this.
嘿，你必須停止這樣做。

343
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:01,860
I'm working on commission here.
我在這裡做佣金工作。

344
00:16:03,260 --> 00:16:03,960
Hey, guys.
嘿，夥計們。

345
00:16:04,480 --> 00:16:05,660
I'm here to pick out my Christmas tree.
我是來挑選我的聖誕樹的。

346
00:16:05,860 --> 00:16:07,200
Well, look no further.
好吧，別再看了。

347
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,300
This one's yours.
這是你的。

348
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:13,720
Is this the one that I threw out last year?
這是我去年丟掉的那個嗎？

